legal_answer.answer:
The crime of losing military weapons is defined in Article 308 of the Penal Code 2015. Specifically, if someone entrusted with military weapons negligently allows them to be lost and this results in one or more of the following consequences, they will face imprisonment from 6 months to 3 years or up to 3 years' corrective labor: 

a) Causing death to one person or causing injury or damage to health resulting in a disability rate of over 61%;
b) Causing injury or damage to health to two people with each person's disability rate between 31% and 60%;
c) Causing injury or damage to health to three or more people where the total disability rate of all individuals involved is between 61% and 121%;
d) Causing property damage ranging from 100 million VND to less than 500 million VND.

